  "bio": "Lina Junora is a masterful fineline tattoo artist based in Enskede, Sweden, well-known for her intricate and delicate designs that exemplify her exceptional attention to detail. At her studio, Narval Tattoo in Stockholm, Lina maintains the highest standards of cleanliness, ensuring that every client's experience is not only aesthetically pleasing but also hygienic and safe. To book a session with this talented artist, reach out via direct message for an opportunity to adorn your skin with her exquisite artistry.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Enskede, Stockholm County, Sweden"
